@JwtAuthApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5010

### Teste 1 — Login válido (200 OK + token)
# @name login
POST {{JwtAuthApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usuario": "aluno",
  "senha": "senha123"
}

### Teste 2 — Login inválido (401 Unauthorized)
POST {{JwtAuthApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usuario": "aluno",
  "senha": "senhaErrada"
}

### Teste 3 — Rota protegida sem token (401 Unauthorized)
GET {{JwtAuthApi_HostAddress}}/api/usuario/perfil

### Teste 4 — Rota protegida com token válido (200 OK)
GET {{JwtAuthApi_HostAddress}}/api/usuario/perfil
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}
